===========================================================================
    There are two ways you can install and/or upgrade Wheel of Fortune:

 From WorkBench
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Open up the "WOF" drawer and double click the "WOF_Install" icon.

 From the CLI
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Enter the "WOF/" directory, then type:

    Installer WOF_Install WOF_Install EXPERT EXPERT WOF_Install NOPRETEND

 Once Installation/Upgrade is Complete
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    You can delete the, now empty, WOF/ directory and this file if you wish,
    then do the following to view the doc file(s):

 From WorkBench
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Open up the "pfiles:WoFortune/Guides/" drawer, then double click the
    "README.guide" icon. View the others as you see fit.

 From the CLI
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Enter the "pfiles:WoFortune/Guides/" directory, then type:

    AmigaGuide README.guide

    View the other guides as you see fit.
